    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Informative and evaluative language",
     "texto": [
      "**Informować** means to present data; **oceniać** means to express an assessment.",
      "A text can seem neutral and still suggest a position."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Interpreting tone",
     "texto": [
      "**Ironia** consists of saying something in such a way that the context suggests another meaning.",
      "**podtekst** is not expressed directly, but the reader can work it out."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
